Stonewall is a 2015 American coming-of-age drama film directed by Roland Emmerich, written by Jon Robin Baitz, and starring
Jeremy Irvine, Jonny Beauchamp, Joey King, Caleb Landry Jones, Matt Craven, Jonathan Rhys Meyers, and Ron Perlman.

11
01:34:36,000 --> 01:34:42,000
The film is set in and around the 1969 Stonewall riots, a violent clash with
police that sparked the gay liberation movement in New York City.

